            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/iodigital-com/macOS-app-releases/releases?q=aivis&amp;expanded=true</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Users can choose between their existing API key or a project key.
- Optional key management is linked to account settings; the app does not open automatically.
- Default image tagging uses predefined aliases; custom models are still available.
- Each job keeps its credential selection during upload delays and retries; credential issues do not impact engine choice.
]]></description>
